# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HSTS is deliberately NOT enabled yet.
#
# It tells browsers "only ever reach this site over HTTPS, for a year".
# Turning it on before the Let's Encrypt certificate is live locks visitors
# out entirely: HTTP is refused, HTTPS fails, and there is no way to bypass it.
#
# Once https://trantofire.au loads with a padlock and Force HTTPS is on,
# uncomment the line below and redeploy.
#
#   Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
#
# Leave "preload" off unless you are certain — it is submitted to a list baked
# into browsers and is very difficult to reverse.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Content-Security-Policy below allows FastComments and nothing else new.
# If a thread ever fails to load, open the browser console: a CSP block names
# the exact origin it refused, and that origin gets added to the matching
# directive here.
#
# One known interaction: Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin will break
# social login pop-ups if you ever switch those on in FastComments. Anonymous
# and email commenting are unaffected.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://cdn.fastcomments.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdn.fastcomments.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdn.fastcomments.com; img-src 'self' data: https://cdn.fastcomments.com https://fastcomments.com; connect-src 'self' https://fastcomments.com https://cdn.fastcomments.com wss://fastcomments.com; frame-src https://fastcomments.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'

/js/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/mark.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/favicon.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
